# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo regardless of platform checkout
# settings. Without this, Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true convert
# committed LF files to CRLF locally, which makes `black --check` and `git
# diff` report spurious whole-file changes that aren't really there.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
